{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-38","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":38,"points":null,"unitId":"immune","unitLabel":"면역학","topic":"항체·항원·면역","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["immune","biomol","signaling"],"stem":"세그룹의실험쥐에항원BSA(bovine serum albumin)를1차\n주입한뒤, 한달후2차로BSA, 변성된BSA, HEL(hen egg-\nwhite lysozyme)을각각주입하였다. 각그룹의실험쥐에서BSA\n에대한1차및2차면역반응의항체생성반응과세포성면역반응을\n조사한결과는아래표와같다.\n항\n원\n1차면역반응\n2차면역반응\n1차\n2차\n항체생성\n세포성면역\n항체생성\n세포성면역\n주입\n주입\n반응\n반응\n반응\n반응\nBSA\nBSA\n+\n+\n+++\n+++\n변성된\nBSA\n+\n+\n+/-\n+++\nBSA\n+\n+\n-\n-\nBSA\nHEL\n-\n: 반응이없음\n+\n: 약한반응\n+++ : 매우강한반응\n위실험결과에대한설명이나추론중옳은것을<보기>에서\n고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 변성된항원은B-세포의항원으로작용할수없다.\nㄴ. B-세포수용체는항원단백질의3차구조를인지한다.\nㄷ. 2차면역반응에서B-세포는대식세포의도움으로항원을\n인지한다.\nㄹ. T-세포수용체는항원단백질이분해되어생성된펩티드\n의1차구조를인지한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040","t041","t042","t043","t044","t045","t046","t047","t048","t049","t050","t051","t052","t053","t054","t055"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t056"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t057"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t058"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t059"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t060"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":772,"height":361,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,97.06,308.8,144.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t